+
+### Explicit routing diagnostic target
+
+The optional creation-time `SandboxSpec.log_level` remains empty by default.
+The CLI exposes a validated `--log-level` pass-through for direct creates;
+workload templates keep their own immutable specification. A dedicated
+`openshell.routing_http` DEBUG target recognizes only the exact account-check
+GET without a query. It retains no request values after recognition and emits
+one finite terminal observation per ordinal after final response parsing.
+Normal forwarding and errors remain unchanged; no broad HTTP logger is enabled.
+This observation cannot classify account JSON decoding or failures that occur
+before exact L7 endpoint recognition.
